  &lt;h1 align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;Epicenter&lt;/h1&gt;
  &lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;Local-first, open-source apps&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p align=&#34;center&#34;&gt;Own your data. Use any model you want. Free and open source ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📢 Repository Update:&lt;/strong&gt; The &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/braden-w/whispering/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Whispering&lt;/a&gt; repository is now part of &lt;strong&gt;Epicenter&lt;/strong&gt;! You can find it &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/epicenter-so/epicenter/tree/main/apps/whispering&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;here&lt;/a&gt;. Everything else remains the same—same tools, same philosophy, same team.&lt;/p&gt;
